        "en": "Mim sakinah has three rules.",
        "bm": "Mim sakinah mempunyai tiga hukum."
      },
      {
        "en": "Verses guide us on brotherhood, trust and hope in Allah's forgiveness.",
        "bm": "Ayat membimbing tentang persaudaraan, amanah dan harapan kepada keampunan Allah."
